======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 126 - Command Query Responsibility Segregation (CQRS)
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Single database schema serving both high-volume transactional writes and complex analytics queries.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   CQRS: Writes modify relational tables; asynchronous events update Elasticsearch read models.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
